<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHP" style="id">Bugun: Bible Translation 1st Edition</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF8)</para>
  <para style="h">Philiphithek</para>
  <para style="toc1">PHILIPHITHEK shii Phaul re-è Jigigam</para>
  <para style="toc2">Philiphithek</para>
  <para style="toc3">Phi</para>
  <para style="mt1">PHILIPHITHEK</para>
  <para style="mt2">Shii Phaul Re-è Jigigam</para>
  <para style="imt">Yaophi</para>
  <para style="ip">Phaul ro Jigigam Philiphithek shii zey pha ji ne Masedonia du-ùa pha Roman European nyiak shii Phaul è igobi rab pha charch shii zey. Hì ne guaphasamoy phatheg hà um muii shii zey, chiih-è hì ne gai Masipho bliaphothek pha suang è awai shii diig phi mage pha ishak shii chiih-è Philiphi pha charch shii biidiie pha muyua ji è diig rey dun. Thuh de hì pha jigigam è lubo yi chiih-è Isu Masi shii Phaul ro jam migi ji è nyayao mua.</para>
  <para style="ip">Jigigam Khthiie zey pha chiang ne Philiphi Masiphothek è airo chid pha ishak shii ithek è aishii nong phi pha lasen thoh ge pha chiang è laso phi. Ai è awai ro ishak shii khoh srane ithek izai rek yi, ji è ithek ne airo diigchiaothek shii nane awaithek ro wie shii lububo rek ne izai now yi. Ai è ithek shii munyua miiyang nane wiangwe shii phrai mua pha jum ziig ne Isu shii um bone khung. Ithek ro chai Masi rog shii um pha ji ne Hamangkhung-aphuii ro bushun lasen rone ai è ithek shii nowkhlei yi, Jewthek ro Iphey ji è mua pha asi pha nyie ji ne ithek è migi è muage ro. Ai è hanyie yi Masi rog shii ò sieng pha ji shii ne Hamangkhung-aphuii è lubo nane liijiing phi rone zey ro.</para>
  <para style="ip">Hì pha jigigam ne lubo, luthong, ò jia nane zud ne Masipho migi nane chai shii chuh rek bone gang è cheb rek phi. Hì de Phaul è Philiphi pha charch shii jam è miie rey rone dong phi ro.</para>
  <para style="iot">Iliing shii um pha ji</para>
  <para style="io1">Yaophi <char style="ior">(<ref loc="PHP 1:1-11">1:1-11</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Phaul awairo Ishak <char style="ior">(<ref loc="PHP 1:12-26">1:12-26</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Masi shii chai <char style="ior">(<ref loc="PHP 1:27">1:27</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 2:18">2:18</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Thimothi nane Ephaphrodithus ro muphak <char style="ior">(<ref loc="PHP 2:19-30">2:19-30</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Makphothek nane buiithek shii phriie <char style="ior">(<ref loc="PHP 3:1">3:1</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 4:9">4:9</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Phaul nane airo Philiphi pha ijakthek <char style="ior">(<ref loc="PHP 4:10-20">4:10-20</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Jongsha <char style="ior">(<ref loc="PHP 4:21-23">4:21-23</ref>)</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHP 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 1:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 16:12">Blk 16:12</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Masi Isu ro khiaothek Phaul nane Thimothi re-è—Hamangkhung-aphuii ro branthek Philiphi shii rai pho hanyie yi Masi Isu rog shii ò rek pha, Charch pha dumuiithek lao ne chiih-è nongphothek shii de:<verse eid="PHP 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 1:2"/>Hamangkhung-aphuii gathek ro Aphuii nane Ithong Isu Masi è nathek shii bushun nane liijiing phi bo.<verse eid="PHP 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Phaul è airo thampho shii sia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 1:3"/>Gu idang ishak nathek shii now shii gu ne gui Hamangkhung-aphuii shii nathek chiang laso phi;<verse eid="PHP 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 1:4"/>Chiih-è gu zab ishak nathek zab shii sia shii, gu ne lubo rog shii sia <verse eid="PHP 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 1:5"/>nyieliieshii nathek è igobi è thuh thog pha mua pha blia shii nathek è gu shii nong phi ro. <verse eid="PHP 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 1:6"/>Ji-è thuh gu ne thieg Hamangkhung-aphuii hanyie è hì pha wie blia ne nathek duchoi jao pha ji ne, Masi Isu pha Inai ajong sapho shii ne rek ne rai ruii phro. <verse eid="PHP 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 1:7"/>Nathek ne idang gu lubu shii um ro! Chiih-è gu rek pha nathek chiang shii than pha ne gu shii khriig um bie ro. Chiih-è Hamangkhung-aphuii è gu shii phi pha jo shii thuh gu ne phatheg hà um shii chiih-è fuang hàne mua shii ragia rek pha nane chuh è rab shii de nathek zab ne mathang um ro. <verse eid="PHP 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 1:8"/>Gu ne izai yao rone Hamangkhung-aphuii ne guro khagi ro, gu è nathek chiang guro jam than rone yao mage shii zab ne Masi Isu awai lubu è thog ruii phro.<verse eid="PHP 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 1:9"/>Gu ne sia nathek ro miie ne ò rog shii izai khani nane isiie chua ne muna è muna rey ruii ne, <verse eid="PHP 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 1:10"/>ji è nathek ne nyie yi zab è wie ji gua muii ruii phro. Chiihphado nathek ne gang rey ne the pha Masi ro inai è ichad rey ruii phro. <verse eid="PHP 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 1:11"/>Hamangkhung-aphuii ro chiong nane biisiie chiang pha nathek ro chaithek ne wie pha ichuathek nyie yi Isu è rek mua bie pha ji è zan ro.<verse eid="PHP 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sieng pha ne Masi ro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 1:12"/>Gu nathek shii thieg yi pha yang ro, gu ijakthek, gu shii rey pha manathek ne izai mua shii ibi shii yi pha nong ro. <verse eid="PHP 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 1:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 28:30">Blk 28:30</ref></char></note>Idohhè shii, zab saja ro hò pha arming nane zab gai ichiih um pha ji ne gu phatheg hà um rone thieg nyieliieshii gu ne Masi ro khiao ro. <verse eid="PHP 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 1:14"/>Chiih-è gu phatheg hà um pha ji ne bajo migiphothek ne Ithong shii muna lububo rey dun, ji è ithek ne zab pha ishak shii mua ne arumdang pha yua<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:14: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mua </char><char style="ft" closed="false">giak jigi shii um</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Hamangkhung-aphuii mua. </char></note> pha lububo rey dun.<verse eid="PHP 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 1:15"/>Zai ji ne ithek gai ne Masi ji yua nyieliieshii miegriie pha nane gui, jimagunde gai ne wie yang pha ji è rek. <verse eid="PHP 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 1:16"/>Ji rek pha ji ne miie è ro, nyieliieshii ithek ne thieg Hamangkhung-aphuii è gu shii ne mua shii ragia rek pha blia phijong ro. <verse eid="PHP 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 1:17"/>Gaithek ne Masi shii isiie è ayao ro, jimagunde munyua miiyang pha ragung è; gu phatheg hà ba shii ithek ne gu shii muna diig phi ruii pha rek.<verse eid="PHP 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 1:18"/>Hì ne nyie miyao de oi ro! Masi ro yua pha ji shii ne asi pha now magunde si pha now magunde zab rey now pha jine athodang pha sang ro— Chiih-è gu ne idang sang ruii <verse eid="PHP 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 1:19"/>nyieliieshii naro misiathek re-è chiih-è Isu Masi ro ragung è nyie nong gu shii rek pha ji è ichad rek phi ruii phro ne gu thieg ro. <verse eid="PHP 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 1:20"/>Guro jam chid pha ji nane luthong ne guro blia shii gu ne khuchung de buyud arey yi pha, jimagunde idang pha ishak, chiih-è thuh shii, gu ne ley lububo rek chid, ji è guro zab pha blia shii guro chai shii sieng magunde iy magunde gu ne Masi shii biisiie rek chid. <verse eid="PHP 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 1:21"/>Chiih-è guro chai ne nyie lei? Gu sieng pha ne Masi bey. Chiihphado, iy pha ji ne gu shii phua ro <verse eid="PHP 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 1:22"/>Jishii athodang pha ji è sieng arone wie blia muna rek mua, chiihphado gu ne ayao mua gu ne nyie gua chid. <verse eid="PHP 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 1:23"/>Gune ithua nyi shii ri. Gune hìpha chai thoh ne Masi rog shii muna sieng pha now ro, nyie yi zab è wie mana ro; <verse eid="PHP 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 1:24"/>Jishii nathek chiang shii gu ne isieng rai pha mugak ba ro. <verse eid="PHP 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 1:25"/>Gu ne hì nyayao mua, chiih-è ji è gu ne thieg gu ne rai. Nathek ro Migi shii lubo nane ibi rey pha ji shii pha chodo phi pha, gu ne nathek rog shii rai ruii ne, <verse eid="PHP 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 1:26"/>Ji-è gu nathek rog shii dinne um mage shii, nathek shii nathek ro chai Masi rog shii um pha chiang shii gu chiang shii wiangwe ne muna rek pha chiang um phro.<verse eid="PHP 1:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 1:27"/>Thuh, mugak pha mana ne hì ro nathek ro chai ne Masi ro mua duiine um chid, ji è dinne gu nathek shii riig pha awuii mua magunde, chiih-è jia chid pha ji shii nathek ne mua migi shii ò mak rek muii rone chiih-è nathek ne blia jia shii chuh è riu rone gu ne yoi ruii phro. <verse eid="PHP 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 1:28"/>Nawaithek ro mak shii arum chid rabo; idang lububo rek bo, chiih-è hì ne khagi rek ruii phro ithek ne mua dun chiih-è nathek yang ruii phro, nyieliieshii hì ne Hamangkhung-aphuii è hanyie shii yang phi ruii phro. <verse eid="PHP 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 1:29"/>Nathek shii ne Masi ro blia rek pha jo phijong ro, aishii migi rek bie pha ji asi ro, jishii ai chiang shii diigchiao zud rek pha phi phro. <verse eid="PHP 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 1:30"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:19-40">Blk 16:19-40</ref></char></note>Thuh shii nathek de mak hà gu rog shii ichua nyayie mua phro. Igobi gu è mak rek pha ji nathek è doh pha mak ò ji ro, chiih-è nathek yoi pha gu thuh de mak rek ramuii pha jia ji ro.<verse eid="PHP 1:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PHP 2"/>
  <para style="s">Masi ro jum nane bohthek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 2:1"/>Nathek ro chai shii Masi è nathek shii gang rab phi, chiih-è airo miie è nathek shii liijiing rek phi. Nathek ne Ragung<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:1: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Nathek ne Ragung rog shii òsia um ro; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">dinne </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ragung è nathek shii ò sia hà noh phi ro.</char></note> rog shii ò rek bo, chiih-è nathek ne nawaithek chung bushun nane zo rai bo. <verse eid="PHP 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 2:2"/>Chiihphado, gu nathek shii khung, ò nowthek, ò miie shii thang rai, chiih-è ragung nane khani shii ò rek ne gu shii zab sang yi pha rab mage bo. <verse eid="PHP 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 2:3"/>Nyigodog rek pha munyua miiyang nane buii chid pha ji arek rabo, jimagunde nawaithek chung jum rek rai bo, idang nawaithek shii è ne gai wie ba rone now bo. <verse eid="PHP 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 2:4"/>Chiih-è nawai shii asi bie pha, nawaithek chung nyu rai pha ji shii riig bo. <verse eid="PHP 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 2:5"/>Nathek shii nyie ziig um pha ji ne Masi Isu shii um pha jia ji ro:<verse eid="PHP 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 2:6"/>Ai ne idang Hamangkhung-aphuii shii ziig um,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:6">Jishii ai ne Hamangkhung-aphuii rog shii ò rek pha bangchiie anow<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:6: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">noh din yi; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">dinne </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">dun ruii, thogruii.</char></note> ro.<verse eid="PHP 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 2:7"/>Ji pha chiang shii awai ro thaluii yang ne awai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:7">shii nyie um pha ji zab thoh muii chiih-è khiao pha ziig yie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:7">Ai ne tharothamang duiine re srane</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:7">chiih-è tharothamang duiine dong khlei<verse eid="PHP 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 2:8"/>Ai ne jum chiih-è iy bsa thog dang pha— nuii pha lumuii shii lua</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:8">chiih-è bai hà iy bsa thog dang pha de nuii pha lumuii shii lua<verse eid="PHP 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 2:9"/>Ji pha chiang shii Hamangkhung-aphuii bajo giu ithua lakhung shii aishii hòi phi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:9">chiih-è gai è boh ibeng aishii phi muii.<verse eid="PHP 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 2:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:10,11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 45:23">Aij 45:23</ref> (LXX)</char>
    </note> Chiih-è ji è Isu beng shii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:10">hamangkhung shii um pha ji, sohjambling shii um pha ji,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:10">chiih-è sohniak pha ji shii ne ai lagiungthek shii niing <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:10: </char><char style="fk" closed="false">sohjambling luii: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">hamangkhung shii um pha ji, soh shii um pha ji.</char></note> ruii phro.<verse eid="PHP 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 2:11"/>Chiih-è Hamangkhung-aphuii pha Aphuii ro biisiie pha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:11">Isu Masi Ithong rone zab ne hong ne yao ruii phro.<verse eid="PHP 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sohjambling shii muchuangthek duiine khlieng bo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 2:12"/>Ji-è chiihphado, bushun ijakthek, gu nathek rog um shii nathek è gu shii idang nuii phi, thuh gu nathek è ruang shii nathek gu shii nuii phi pha ji ne muna mugak ba ro. Nawaithek ro giawo ji zab rek pha rum ne sam pha rog shii rek bo, <verse eid="PHP 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 2:13"/>nyieliieshii Hamangkhung-aphuii ne idang nathek shii blia rek ne chiih-è yang rab ne awairo blia shii nuii yi pha rab phi ro.<verse eid="PHP 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 2:14"/>Phosro nane akhnaing pha zab rek bo, <verse eid="PHP 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 2:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:5">Iphy 32:5</ref></char></note> ji è nathek ne hanyie yi awie pha sohjambling nane layog bran shii rai pha ji è, ichiig oi pha nane igang Hamangkhung-aphuii ro isiie ani rey bo. Nathek è chai pha mua ithek shii phi pha duiine, nathek ne hamang hà dadiangthek chuang pha duiine ithek lakhung shii khlieng chid. <verse eid="PHP 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 2:16"/>Ji-è nathek rek arone, Masi pha Inai shii nathek shii wiangwe rek pha chiang um ruii phro, nyieliieshii hì è ne zab gu miwiang nane blia ne adobo arey rone doh yi phro.<verse eid="PHP 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 2:17"/>Yangne guro chai ifai sun phi pha duiine khlem phi shii nathek ro migi yi Hamangkhung-aphuii shii phi bo. Ji-è ji ne ji arone, guro lised ne guro lubo ne nathek zab rog shii thang. <verse eid="PHP 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 2:18"/>Ji duiine, nathek ne lised bo chiih-è nathek ro lubo ne gu rog shii thang bo.<verse eid="PHP 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Thimothi nane Ephaphrodithus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 2:19"/>Hì yi Ithong è yang arone, gu ne luthong Thimothi shii khthiie gu ne nathek hà thoh mua, ji è gu ne nathek chiang pha mua è lububo rek. <verse eid="PHP 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 2:20"/>Ai ne jia ro hanyie è gu muthanthek shii thang chiih-è hanyie yi izai nathek chiang shii gayiig phi. <verse eid="PHP 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 2:21"/>Zab ne awaithek ro phua shii samdiig bie ne, Isu Masi chiang rog shii asi ro. <verse eid="PHP 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 2:22"/>Chiih-è ai ne awairo blia ne igong shii nyie khi-èrek ne khagi rek pha ji nathek nawaithek ne thieg, nyie khi-èrek ne ai nane gune, dufuii nane awai aphuii duiine mua chiang shii ò blia rek. <verse eid="PHP 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 2:23"/>Ji-è gu ne thieg nyie khi-èrek ne zabthek ne gu chiang thog ruii ne aishii ne nathek hà khthiie thoh ge pha gu ne luthong ro. <verse eid="PHP 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 2:24"/>Gu gui ne nathek shii khthiie wuii mua ruii phro ne gu ne Ithong shii migi rek.<verse eid="PHP 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 2:25"/>Gu è nowjong gathek ro ikhuii Ephaphrodithus shii nathek hà thoh ge phane mugak ro, hanyie yi blia rek ne gu chiang shii ragung pha mak rek ne hanyie yi nathek ro muapho duiine gu shii nong phi ne blia rek phi ro. <verse eid="PHP 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 2:26"/>Ai ne nathek zab shii bajo riig yang chiih-è bajo samdiig rek nyieliieshii ai ne rad muii rone nathek ne yoijong.<verse eid="PHP 2:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 2:27"/>Zai ai ne rad ne achiih iy pha rek ro. Jishii Hamangkhung-aphuii aishii bushun rek, chiih-è aishii asi bie pha jimagunde gu shii de rek phi, chiih-è dinne muna duhug shii de ragia rek phi. <verse eid="PHP 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 2:28"/>Chiihphado, gu ne aishii nathek hà thoh ge pha zab muna yangmuii ro, ji è nathek ne dinne aishii riig mage shii lised ruii phro, chiih-è gui ro duhug ne jongdun ro. <verse eid="PHP 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 2:29"/>Chiihphado, Ithong shii khuiino duiine, lubo rog, aishii choi bo. Ai duiine rek pha zab bran shii ilab doh yi bo. <verse eid="PHP 2:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 2:30"/>Nyieliieshii ai ne nawaithek è aphi mua pha nong ji gu shii phi pha, awai chai shii Masi ro blia chiang è achiih iy pha jiriak rek.<verse eid="PHP 2:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PHP 3"/>
  <para style="s">Zai giangthek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 3:1"/>Jong sha, gu ijakthek, nawaithek ro Ithong shii ò pha ji shii lubo rek bo. Gu è igobi shii nyie zey pha ji zey din pha ne gu buii anow, chiih-è gu rek chak arone nathek shii ne ragia rek ruii phro. <verse eid="PHP 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 3:2"/>Hanyie è ji pha awie pha jithek shii rekpho shii, jithek pha chiiethek shii, hanyie è siu shii laig pha bangchiie rek pho wie è riig bo. <verse eid="PHP 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 3:3"/>Hanyie è izai migiangkheg pha ji mua pha hì ne gethek ro, ithek asi ro, chiih-è gethek è airo Ragung è Hamangkhung-aphuii shii misiasia chiih-è gethek chai Masi Isu rog shii ò um pha ji shii sang ro. Gethek ne fuang pha migiangkheg pha ji shii ne migi arek ro. <verse eid="PHP 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 3:4"/>Gu ne jithek pha zabthek shii migi shii rek mua pha de um phro. Nathek è hanyie jia yi fuang pha migiangkheg pha ji shii migi rek mua phro ne now arone, ji shii than phane gu ne muna chiang um ro. <verse eid="PHP 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 3:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:1">Rom 11:1</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 23:6">Blk 23:6</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:5">26:5</ref></char></note>Gune habda rey shii, gu shii ne migiangkheg muii. Gu ne Israelthek è giak pha, igang ifai Hebrew, Benjamin jad ro. Jewish Iphey è yao ne, nya ruii dang shii, gu ne Pharisi, <verse eid="PHP 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 3:6"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:3">Blk 8:3</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:4">22:4</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:9-11">26:9-11</ref></char></note>chiih-è gu è charch shii diigchiao phi pha ji shii bajo miegriie. Iphey pha muyungthek ji nuii ne branthek ne giang re arone, gu ne ichiig oi ro. <verse eid="PHP 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 3:7"/>Jishii jithek pha manathek shii gu è phua rone tham pha ji ne thuh gu tham shii Masi chiang adubo rey dun ro. <verse eid="PHP 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 3:8"/>Jithek pha mana ji asi bie pha, nyie yi mana gunchid pha gu Ithong Masi Isu pha khani chiang è, gu ne zab ne adubo tham dun ro. Ai chiang è gu ne zab thoh muii; gu ne zab shii izea-ikho duiine now muii, nyieliieshii gu ne Masi shii yang mua <verse eid="PHP 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 3:9"/>chiih-è ai rog shii zab ò rek mua. Gu ne guilum ne giangthek oi ro, jithek pha ichua ne Iphey nuii pha ji è mua ro. Gu shii thuh giang um pha ji ne Masi shii migi ji è phi, giang ji ne Hamangkhung-aphuii è thog ruii chiih-è migi chiang è ro. <verse eid="PHP 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 3:10"/>Zab gu è yang pha ji ne Masi shii thieg bo chiih-è airo hòi pha blu shii than mua chiih-è airo diigchiaothek shii thang bo chiih-è airo iy pha ji shii ai duiine rey bo. <verse eid="PHP 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 3:11"/>Luthong ji è gui ne iy pha ji ne chai è hòi ruii phro.<verse eid="PHP 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jieg shii ran bo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 3:12"/>Gu ne zab yang ge dinne zab khriig sha rone ayao ro. Gu ne nyie yi Isu Masi è awailum ne gu shii yangjong pha lasen ji yang pha bidiang ramuii ro. <verse eid="PHP 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 3:13"/>Ji chak, gu ijakthek, gu ne yangjong rone izai anow ro; <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:13: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">asi; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">giak jigizey shii um </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">thuh de asi.</char></note> mana jia ne gu è rek, jimagunde, gu iidoh shii um pha ji bia srane nyie yi ibi um pha ji thog pha gu ne bajo bidiang rek. <verse eid="PHP 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 3:14"/>Nyie yi Hamangkhung-aphuii è chai lakhung shii Masi Isu chiang è ho pha, jieg ji mua pha gu ne miang ran ro.<verse eid="PHP 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 3:15"/>Zab gethek ne hanyie yi luruak iweg pho ne ò now bo. Jishii nathek gai yi yoh now um arone, Hamangkhung-aphuii è ji nathek shii sang rab phi phro. <verse eid="PHP 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 3:16"/>Jishii, ji ne yangne, cho gethek ne ò khohthek shii thuh thog pha gethek nuii luagieng pha ji shii ibi lua haro.<verse eid="PHP 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 3:17"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 4:16">1Khor 4:16</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:1">11:1</ref></char>
    </note>Gu shii nuii bo, gu ijakthek, gathek è nathek chiang khriig pha miiriig hanyie è luagieng pha ji shii wie yoi bo. <verse eid="PHP 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 3:18"/>Gu è hì ne dohbi hà blebbleb yaojong, chiih-è thuh gu ne miegkhothek rog shii yao din: Ichiih ne bajo hanyie ro chaithek ne Masi bai hà iy dun pha ji shii bajo suang rab ne ruii ro.<verse eid="PHP 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 3:19"/>Ithek ne thumuluii hà jong ruii phro, nyieliieshii ithek ro hamangkhung-aphuii ne ithek ro siu è chid pha ji ro. Ithek ne ithek è nyie wo chid pha ji shii wiangwe rek, chiih-è ithek ne ichiih sohjambling è re pha mana jia ji shii now bie ro. <verse eid="PHP 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 3:20"/>Jishii, gethek, ne hamangkhung pha bran ro, chiih-è gethek ne gethek ro Ragiapho, hamangkhung è wuii ruii pha Ithong Isu Masi yang ne khan phro. <verse eid="PHP 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 3:21"/>Ai ne, blu è zab pha manathek awairo khoh pha iliing shii yie mua pha ji è khoh ne gethek ro zia iy pha siu shii lai ruii ne ithek shii awairo biisiiethek siu duiine rab ruii phro.<verse eid="PHP 3:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PHP 4"/>
  <para style="s">Muyungthek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 4:1"/>Ji-è, chiihphado, gu khuiinothek nane bumuiithek, nathek ne gu shii khama bushun rek chiih-è gu ne nathek shii bajo now muii ro! Nathek è gu shii bajo sang yi ne khama nathek chiang shii gu shii wiangwe rek yi ro! Hì ne chiihphado, gu khuiinothek, nathek ro chai ne Ithong shii khi-èrek ne chuh riu muii pha ji ro.<verse eid="PHP 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 4:2"/>Euodia nane Synthyche, gu nathek shii khung, Ithong shii ne bumuiithek duiine nuii phi bo. <verse eid="PHP 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 4:3"/>Chiih-è na shii de, guro isiie ijak, nathek ne hì pha hò-amuii shii nong phi bone gu yang muii ro; nyieliieshii isa ne Khlementh nane zab gai guro ijak bliaphothek hanyie ro ibeng yi Hamangkhung-aphuii ro chai pha siog shii um pha ji shii, chiih-è gu rog mua shiiy pha ji shii snak ne blia rek gieng.<verse eid="PHP 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 4:4"/>Nathek ro ò Ithong rog shii um pha ji ne idang lubo rek bo. Gu dinne yao: sang bo!<verse eid="PHP 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 4:5"/>Zab shii jum ziig doh yi bo. Ithong ne khthiie wuiiramuii ro. <verse eid="PHP 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 4:6"/>Nyie chiang shii sam-adiig rabo, jimagunde naro zab pha misiathek shii na nyie chid pha ji shii lia bo, idang aishii ne laso pha lubo rog shii lia bo. <verse eid="PHP 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 4:7"/>Chiih-è Hamangkhung-aphuii ro liijiing, nyie yi tharothamang è gao pha ji è muna ruang, Isu Masi rog shii ò pha ji shii nawai ro lubuthek nane khanithek shii ragia ruii bo.<verse eid="PHP 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 4:8"/>Jongsha shii, gu ijakthek, nyie yi wie nane chiong pha ji duiine rey mua pha: Izai pha manathek shii, giu, rangsua, igang, miie, nane ilab yi nawaithek khani rog shii zan bo.<verse eid="PHP 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 4:9"/>Nyimanyi guro miyaogamthek nane guro bliathek, chiih-è nathek ne gu è nyie dab nyie choi pha ji ne nui ne ruii bo. Chiih-è Hamangkhung-aphuii hanyie è gathek shii phi pha liijiing ne nathek rog shii um bo.<verse eid="PHP 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lasen pha chiang shii lasothek phi bo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 4:10"/>Guro chai Ithong rog shii ò um pha ji hì ne gu shii boh lubo rek ne ji pha bajo ishak iidoh shii nathek ne gu shii gayiig rone luang jia doh yi pha jo um ro. Nathek ne gu shii gayiig pha gak muii rone gu ayao ro— nathek ne hì doh yi pha jo ne oi sha ro. <verse eid="PHP 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 4:11"/>Chiih-è nyieliieshii gu ne snai pha than rone ayao ro, chiih-è gu shii nyie um pha ji shii liingsed pha dabjong ro. <verse eid="PHP 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 4:12"/>Gu ne dusho rey pha ji de nyathieg muii chiih-è bajo huak ne um pha ji shii de nyathieg muii. Ji-è khihà de, khi pha ishak hà de, gu ne hì pha ug pha ji shii dabjong, gu ley dinne chi-iy-iy magunde, gu ne bajo dinne ìujia magunde, gu ne liingsed ro. <verse eid="PHP 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 4:13"/>Gu ne Masi è gu shii phi pha blu è zab shii nyarek mua.<verse eid="PHP 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 4:14"/>Jishii nathek è guro diigchiaothek shii nong phi pha ji ne bajo wie ro. <verse eid="PHP 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 4:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:9">2Khor 11:9</ref></char></note>Mua wie yao pha inaithek ibi hà gu è Masedonia thoh maruii ne dun pha ji ne Philiphi nathek ne bajo wie è thieg, nathek ne gu shii nong phi pha charch ji bie; guro phua pha nane chun pha shii thang pha ji nathek bie ro.<verse eid="PHP 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 4:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 17:1">Blk 17:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Gu ne blebbleb Thesalonikha hà nathek nong ched mage shii, nathek è ji gu shii thoh ge. <verse eid="PHP 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 4:17"/>Hì ne gu lasenthek mua bie pha yang pha asi ro; ji pha chiang shii, gu ne nathek sasab shii phua ji chodo phi pha yang ro. <verse eid="PHP 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 4:18"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:18">Mul 29:18</ref></char></note>Ichiih, chiihphado, nathek è zab gu shii phi pha ji ne guro sasab ro— Chiih-è hì ne bajo cho sha ro! Nathek ro zab lasenthek Ephaphrodithus è yie ne gu shii yie phi pha ji ne thuh gu nyie chid pha zab ji ne rey sha ro. Khlem pha nyie yi nuii sbo pha chiih-è aishii sang yi pha, ithek ne rem no pha ji yi Hamangkhung-aphuii shii zid pha ji duiine ro. <verse eid="PHP 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 4:19"/>Chiih-è Masi Isu chiang airo zab nuruii ley phi pha ji, guro Hamangkhung-aphuii è nathek chidthek shii zab phi ruii phro. <verse eid="PHP 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 4:20"/>Gathek ro Hamangkhung-aphuii nane Aphuii ro biisiie ne idang nane idang re bo! Amen.<verse eid="PHP 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Idohhè pha salamthek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 4:21"/>Hanyie yi Masi Isu è rey pha Hamangkhung-aphuii pha branthek zab jia shii salam ro. Ichiih gu rog shii um pha migiphothek è de nathek shii salamthek ren ge ro. <verse eid="PHP 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 4:22"/>Hanyie yi Bisiu ithua è rey pho shii, Ichiih pha zab Hamangkhung-aphuii ro branthek è salamthek ren ge ro. <verse eid="PHP 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 4:23"/>Ithong Isu Masi ro bushun ne nathek zab rog shii rey bo.<verse eid="PHP 4:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 4"/>
</usx>
